# Compiled mock binary from the manual build in README.md.
# Anchored to this exact path: a bare "mock-ocr" pattern would also match the
# testdata/mock-ocr/ SOURCE directory, silently ignoring any new scenario file
# added there.
/testdata/mock-ocr/mock-ocr

/coverage.out

# A bare `go build ./testdata/mock-ocr/` drops the binary in the module
# root; the README's -o form puts it under testdata instead. Both are
# build artifacts.
/mock-ocr
